ics to ensure compliance with various codes of conduct from major global brands.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Our experienced auditors are trained on multiple brand-specific codes and deliver thorough, unbiased assessments that help suppliers meet the expectations of their buyers while improving their own operations and worker welfare.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is a Code of Conduct Audit?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A Code of Conduct audit is a third-party assessment that evaluates a supplier&#x27;s or manufacturer&#x27;s compliance with the ethical, social, and environmental standards defined by a specific brand or retailer. These audits typically cover labor practices, health &amp; safety, environmental management, business ethics, and sub-contracting controls.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784010968/cc_vbkvof.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Code of Conduct Audits"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of Code of Conduct <span class="text-euro-600">Audits</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Brand-Specific Code Audits</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive audits against specific ethical codes set by major global brands and retailers.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-store text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Retailer Code Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification of compliance with retailer-specific standards covering labor, safety, and ethics.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Labor Standards Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough evaluation of labor prac